SY_TALK("FN05td6USHA",[[6,["What have I done for God? Sidney, Australia, 19920211"]],[11,["Very good idea to have a good lounge."]],[14,["I wish they have it in every airport."]],[23,["But they, in India they don't even allow Me inside the airport"]],[27,["It's difficult."]],[48,["In Perth, we had this Ganesha Puja,"]],[51,["and I really spoke very nicely on equilibrium."]],[56,["And the rain, expressed its equilibrium,"]],[62,["but when they were singing, it was very quiet."]],[67,["And when it stopped for a short time suddenly it came"]],[70,["with a complete gusto and sang some songs and went away again."]],[74,["Just for the aarti to start with. It’s very beautiful it was."]],[78,["So dramatic."]],[80,["Is very interesting."]],[94,["So all preparations are done for the puja?"]],[98,["Maybe some people might come up from abroad, I don’t know, maybe."]],[106,["Have you written to some leaders or not?"]],[109,["About this puja that we are going to have?"]],[112,["Yogi: I think yes some invitations were sent out."]],[114,["Shri Mataji: Might have gone out."]],[116,["Yogi: There are one or two people coming."]],[119,["Shri Mataji: They might come. Yogi: Only individuals."]],[121,["I invited a few people at Ganapatipule and they said;"]],[124,["‘Oh, it’s such a long way.’ And I said: ‘But you always expect us"]],[127,["to come to yours. Shri Mataji: Yes."]],[131,["They have to move."]],[138,["Columbus could go to America, why not you people go to Australia?"]],[143,["Can’t understand."]],[150,["Yogi: And a much more comfortable trip."]],[152,["Shri Mataji: Yes, much more comfortable. They found"]],[155,["a much more comfortable place to live in."]],[159,["He was really lost. But in a way thank God, you see?"]],[164,["Otherwise there would have been no Indian left in India,"]],[167,["if he had come here by chance."]],[192,["Come forward, come forward, you come forward here."]],[196,["Yes, good."]],[230,["So many flowers, beautiful."]],[244,["[Marathi/Hindi]"]],[274,["The children can come here in front, come along."]],[294,["How many of you are suffering from hepatitis?"]],[303,["Can you come this side? Who else?"]],[310,["Only one?"]],[316,["They told Me ten are suffering."]],[395,["In Singapore I bought a book, very interesting,"]],[401,["called as: ‘Faces of Islam.’"]],[405,["And I was surprised that the whole concept of Islam is Sahaja."]],[410,["Absolutely."]],[413,["And all the, authors and all the people,"]],[419,["who have discussed there, are saying that Muslims are not Islamic."]],[425,["They don’t follow Islam. That’s why","their whole thing has become so rigid."]],[430,["I mean so surprising that book has revealed to Me the confessions,"]],[434,["of these people. And the society that Mohammed Sahib has talked about is ours."]],[442,["Muslims are nowhere. Absolutely the way He has described"]],[445,["how the brotherhood would be there, how righteousness would be there."]],[451,["But one thing is missing I feel, that He said:"]],[454,["\"You must seek the knowledge. You must seek the Truth.\""]],[458,["Despite that, whatever was Islam, they are free to seek"]],[462,["the knowledge and to learn from others. Can you imagine?"]],[466,["And He has said how to deal with non-Muslims also."]],[469,["And they said that there are many who are just minimal Muslims."]],[473,["Some of them are just for name’s sake, they are not Muslims."]],[476,["I mean I was so amazed. We have such a misunderstanding,"]],[480,["that I always said that all these Incarnations and Prophets,"]],[485,["came to establish a religion which was really Sahaja Yoga."]],[491,["All their expectations were Sahaja Yoga."]],[494,["And they have deviated so much,"]],[498,["that you start wondering what is this, as in Christianity, you see."]],[502,["How much it has deviated, Christianity, to what level it has gone,"]],[507,["it is shocking, really shocking."]],[510,["I don’t know if you know of a book written ‘In God’s Name’."]],[515,["And in that book, it reads like a novel actually,"]],[521,["I mean it’s very interesting. In that","book the writer has suggested that"]],[527,["this present pope is responsible for the murder of the previous one."]],[532,["And there were thirteen or fourteen murders took place,"]],[536,["just to hide this. Can you beat it?"]],[540,["And recently one of the persons was murdered was Calvi."]],[544,["And they say, that this Calvi was murdered,"]],[549,["It was - I mean every week in Italy since I am there,"]],[553,["some new exposures are coming. But this Calvi was murdered"]],[557,["in a way that he was hanged on one of the bridges of London."]],[563,["And if he was, he was the one, the one who murdered him,"]],[570,["he said that: \"I am a member of mafia, all right,"]],[576,["but I was paid by this Vatican, by this pope,"]],[579,["for murdering that man.\" Is a confession from him."]],[583,["And Mr Heard was questioned:"]],[588,["\"Why didn’t you take action against this when these things"]],[591,["happen in England?\" He says: ‘What’s the use? Because they would kill"]],[594,["all our lawyers, our judges, everyone. It’s all mafia.\""]],[599,["So the whole system of Catholic Church is nothing but mafia."]],[604,["Nine million dollars of counterfeit were printed and were distributed"]],[613,["through their bank, that is Vatican Bank. Can you believe it?"]],[620,["I mean this is Christianity. Is this what Christ preached?"]],[626,["Killing people, doing all kinds of things."]],[628,["I mean nowhere I find Mohammed decrying anyone. He said:"]],[633,["\"You have to believe in everyone\". Only these people are saying,"]],[636,["that He was the last."]],[639,["He went to this limit to say that: \"I am not Divine."]],[644,["I follow the Divine laws but I am not Divine.\""]],[647,["May be just He wanted people to follow."]],[652,["Surprising I was really surprised that"]],[656,["if Koran is teaching such great things,"]],[660,["the Muslims are just on the other side of it and they admit"]],[665,["that Islam should not be confused with Muslims."]],[673,["In the same way we can say that Christianity should not be"]],[676,["confused with Christians. What about Judaism?"]],[681,["Same thing. I mean nowhere in that religion"]],[685,["taught to be like this, the way they are behaving."]],[689,["They are following Hitler, out and out. The one who killed them,"]],[693,["tortured them, they are becoming just like them."]],[698,["So what to say about these human beings as under the name of God,"]],[702,["under the name of religion, behaving like this?"]],[705,["The reason they have given many: \"Because of this and because of that.\""]],[708,["Just a minute, will you pleas keep quiet?"]],[711,["You must bahave. You are Sahaja Yogis, aren't you?"]],[714,["You are Sahaja Yogis or not? Sahaja Yogis don't bekave like that."]],[718,["See how nicely they are all sitting."]],[724,["So, this aspect that they are saying that:"]],[732,["\"Because the people didn’t read Koran properly,"]],[736,["they didn’t understand properly, they should have been educated properly.\""]],[739,["It will take thousand years to educate every Muslim about it."]],[756,["And if they think that by teaching through their Book,"]],[762,["it will be imbibed, it’s not possible."]],[765,["Everybody reads Bible, everybody reads Koran,"]],[768,["but nothing goes inside just reading, reading, reading."]],[772,["So their idea is that if they read and analyze,"]],[774,["I mean you have to have big universities for that,"]],[777,["it could be taught to people and, still then not necessary,"]],[781,["that they would imbibe."]],[786,["I know of Mahatma Gandhi, you  see, he was a realized soul himself"]],[791,["and he was, of course, over-disciplined according to Me."]],[797,["And he put these ideas on to his followers.","As long as he lived, they were all right."]],[803,["As soon as he died, they came out in their true colors."]],[807,["Everything dropped off like some sort of a mud on their body,"]],[812,["and they became horrible people in India."]],[815,["So the thing missing is this, that they are not realized souls."]],[822,["Because they are not Realized, all these things they cannot bear."]],[826,["They cannot bear money, they cannot bear power."]],[829,["Now I think, they cannot bear the religion."]],[834,["So you have to have your Realization."]],[838,["Unless and until you have your Realization, you cannot bear anything."]],[843,["Moreover in Sahaja Yoga I mean there are no","compulsions, no disciplines as such, I mean,"]],[849,["compared to what we see in all these religions."]],[855,["Suddenly I find people coming up"]],[858,["to the expectations of righteousness, goodness, and they are also very compassionate."]],[869,["So the change has come from inside, that means"]],[873,["it’s the innate change. The innate religion has been awakened."]],[878,["It’s not just forced on you, that you should be Vishwa Nirmala Dharmis,"]],[883,["but you become, you just become that."]],[886,["This is the point you will see, these Prophets did not know,"]],[889,["I think Christ did not know that these people will never change"]],[893,["unless and until they get their Realization."]],[897,["I think He knew also because He always said that you have to be born again."]],[901,["So when He said: ‘You are to be born again,’ they have a brand,"]],[906,["you see again, one are Christian, he is a Born Again,"]],[910,["another are Seventh Day, another, something."]],[912,["All just the same stupid people."]],[917,["But Sahaja Yoga is the only way, where what you say that’s what you follow."]],[924,["Practice and precepts are just the same for Sahaja Yogis."]],[927,["They just can’t do it something else."]],[930,["They are dreaming also that the occident had a very bad influence"]],[934,["on Islam and all that. I don’t think it’s that."]],[938,["You are coming from the occident, still you have jumped into"]],[941,["the right culture of religion,"]],[945,["when you understand what is righteousness what is good. You can bear it."]],[951,["You’re not to be told do this, do that,"]],[954,["but in the light of your Spirit, you do it."]],[957,["And you achieve it."]],[961,["It’s a very interesting thing to note"]],[966,["that a little thing was missing in all of them,"]],[969,["and they just went away as if they never knew where to land."]],[975,["All these religions, one better than the other."]],[980,["Hindus, same thing. Hindus had of course one advantage,"]],[984,["they were never organized, thank God, because if you are organized"]],[987,["and misled, then the whole party goes astray."]],[991,["But Hindus, Hindu scriptures were never organized"]],[995,["into a religion like that. But still, so many points they have missed."]],[1000,["Like it is said that: \"In everyone there resides the Spirit\"."]],[1005,["Then how can you have caste system? You cannot."]],[1011,["But they have caste system."]],[1014,["So, also so many other rituals and things nonsense is there,"]],[1020,["absolutely nonsense."]],[1022,["And Hindu religion became a kind of a ritualistic religion,"]],[1032,["where the priests, uneducated useless priests became in charge."]],[1039,["And they’re so stupid, worse than pope sometimes,"]],[1043,["that they say that if you want to have…"]],[1046,["Whose child is this one? Hello."]],[1049,["You asked for to go back."]],[1051,["You shoudn't talk, you should keep quiet"]],[1055,["Will you pleas go back?"]],[1059,["Only childrem who can sit quiet should come forward."]],[1063,["Alright? Sit down."]],[1075,["I’ve also found out a solution for children, our western children,"]],[1079,["what is the problem."]],[1083,["I went to Japan and what I found there"]],[1088,["that till the age of twelve years, they don’t allow children to have"]],[1093,["much sports, to go out much, and mostly they are in the house"]],[1099,["or in the school, learning to do things with their hands."]],[1105,["And medically I know that, till the age of twelve years,"]],[1109,["there is myelin sheath that grows on your nerves."]],[1114,["And this myelin sheath gives you the deftness."]],[1118,["Like if you go to the villages like Saranti or all these,"]],[1122,["where they are producing artistic things, what happens"]],[1127,["that the children also start doing the same."]],[1130,["It’s so easy for them when they grow up."]],[1132,["So that is the time when they have to develop that deftness."]],[1136,["That deftness is, also makes them more concentrated,"]],[1141,["they get involved into it and also that you can never acquire later."]],[1149,["So that is just a precious time of twelve years"]],[1152,["that that is the time children should be made to do some drawings,"]],[1158,["not at random, but properly, to do some carvings,"]],[1163,["to do some other clay work."]],[1166,["You’ll be surprised by the age of twelve years,"]],[1169,["the boys in Japan could repair a watch,"]],[1172,["could repair televisions, and one boy produced, produced."]],[1177,["At that time when I had gone, there were not many televisions also."]],[1181,["I was surprised that the boy produced a television,"]],[1185,["at the age of twelve years. And also they are given violins"]],[1189,["in their hands when they’re about five years. They start playing."]],[1193,["So the music, art and all this side is developed till the age of twelve years."]],[1198,["And then the children are made to go out and play"]],[1201,["and do all kinds of exercises and also sports."]],[1206,["But they are not let loose at a young age."]],[1212,["Now here I think about twenty years back"]],[1215,["or may be twenty-five years back, a new theme started with children"]],[1221,["that, you should allow the children to do what they like,"]],[1223,["let them express themselves, let them be free, this that."]],[1229,["I think it’s not proper. Otherwise they would be hanging"]],[1232,["from some trees trying to do without parents you see."]],[1235,["After all this is the way the parents escape their duty, I think."]],[1240,["You have to tell children what they have to do."]],[1244,["You have to, talk to them, you must have a rapport with them."]],[1249,["You must talk to them and you must also try to guide them,"]],[1255,["with your experience, tell them what is good what is bad."]],[1259,["But this kind of a thing that the child should be allowed to do"]],[1263,["what they like, express themselves the way they like."]],[1268,["I’ve seen the western children always will ask parents: ‘Why,"]],[1271,["why?’ They are not to know, they have limitations."]],[1276,["They can’t know every ‘why’. How can they understand?"]],[1279,["They are limited and so, first of all, they are to build up."]],[1283,["You can you see this aeroplane now. Supposing it is not built up"]],[1286,["and allowed to go because: \"It’s all right. Let it go in the sky\"."]],[1293,["What will happen?"]],[1296,["In the same way we have to put the nuts and bolts properly"]],[1300,["into them and see that they develop a personality."]],[1306,["That doesn’t mean that you should be in any way cruel to them."]],[1309,["Not necessary. There’s no need to beat them or do anything of the kind."]],[1314,["But only thing is, with love, you should be able to explain to them."]],[1319,["And also dignity, sense of dignity should be there."]],[1323,["Because if you develop their sense of dignity, they will not misbehave."]],[1327,["That’s very important from childhood to give them a sense of dignity,"]],[1330,["that they are Sahaja Yogis and they have to behave."]],[1334,["Because when we started this school one year, first year,"]],[1339,["one month, it was such a problem, I mean, impossible situation."]],[1344,["The teachers gave up and they wrote to Me:"]],[1348,["\"Better send typhoon take children.\" It’s terrible. but they used to beat them"]],[1352,["Not only that, they trouble them, but they used to beat them"]],[1356,["and bite them and do all kinds of","thing and make fun of them. So wild."]],[1362,["And that place is full of cliffs and full of"]],[1365,["all kinds of dangerous heights and they would just run out."]],[1369,["Just like dogs. Dogs are better I would say."]],[1373,["They had no caution about themselves and for one month,"]],[1377,["they all gave up. And the principal has now run away, he said: \"I can’t manage"]],[1380,["these children, they don’t want to study.","They have come here to trouble us, that’s all."]],[1384,["They don’t want to study.\" And first thing when I met them,"]],[1387,["they came and told Me: \"Mother, we don’t want to study.\""]],[1394,["Now we have put a one masseur on them,"]],[1398,["who massages their body. He was telling Me:"]],[1401,["\"They are really funny children, they don’t want to brush their teeth."]],[1404,["If you ask them to brush their teeth they start crying."]],[1406,["They don’t want to have a bath. Tell them 'you have to have your bath',"]],[1410,["they start crying. Anything you tell them they start doing like that.\""]],[1415,["So we can say one thing, that disciplining children in a indirect way"]],[1420,["is very important like that, you see."]],[1423,["Because this idea, that you should leave the children as they are,"]],[1426,["is very wrong. You have to guide them and tell them how to behave."]],[1432,["Now see, you must have seen Indian children how quiet they are."]],[1435,["But I think the attention of children is quite a lot."]],[1439,["And the mothers are not working also, so they look after the children."]],[1444,["Now in our schools that we have here, you should train them up that way."]],[1449,["You can talk to them that: \"You are Sahaja Yogis, you see, you are special people.\""]],[1454,["The other day there was one Indian child, he’s living in Singapore,"]],[1458,["where he has picked up all these bad habits."]],[1461,["He came and he was talking to Me: ‘Grandma, Grandma.’"]],[1466,["And he said: \"I will tell you in Your ear something\"."]],[1470,["And he said something funny. I said: \"Are you a servant?\""]],[1474,["He said: \"No.\" \"Then only servants talk like this."]],[1477,["How are you talking like this?\" \"Is it?\" I said: \"Yes."]],[1480,["This is how the servants talk.\" He got such a fright."]],[1483,["He said: \"All right, I will never talk like that. It’s dirty."]],[1486,["I’ll not talk like that.\" You see, suddenly he changed."]],[1490,["So we have to talk to them, we have to have rapport with them."]],[1494,["After all they are born realized so they have special powers and they are special children."]],[1500,["But ne thing is definite, that children cannot be avoided,"]],[1505,["and you cannot avoid your duty towards","your children. You have to look after them,"]],[1510,["because they are in your trust as it is. They are after all born"]],[1514,["Realized children. They are special children with tremendous brains."]],[1517,["They are cleverer than you and they can outwit you,"]],[1520,["because they are so clever, so intelligent."]],[1523,["But if they get spoiled at this age, then later on it will be very difficult"]],[1526,["to bring them. You were better, because you were not born"]],[1530,["with Realization. So you understood the value of Realization."]],[1534,["But they don’t. So they are to be told that:"]],[1536,["\"You are Realized children, God sent you here, you are special children,"]],[1540,["and what should happen.\" Gradually","they will pick up and understand."]],[1546,["Of course I am happy that so many marriages are successful,"]],[1550,["and people are behaving all right. Of course there are"]],[1553,["some stray cases of fighting going on which I hear about."]],[1557,["This is stupid of course again, that we should fight."]],[1561,["When we are both Sahaja Yogis, what is there to fight?"]],[1564,["I mean, there’s no question."]],[1566,["We believe in all the religions, so we can’t fight on religions."]],[1570,["On what subject can we fight? I just don’t know."]],[1581,["We know the ethics of Sahaja Yoga and we like it,"]],[1585,["so we cannot fight on ethics."]],[1587,["Economics of Sahaja Yoga we understand, we cannot fight on that."]],[1591,["I just don’t understand what is the difference,"]],[1595,["point of difference where they start fighting."]],[1598,["On the contrary in Sahaja Yoga, you can really be"]],[1603,["enjoying your married life. Should be enjoying your married life"]],[1607,["and the children should see to it that \"our","parents are so nicely, quietly settled down.\""]],[1614,["But if they see you quarreling, next day they’ll be quarreling too."]],[1619,["Then we have only monogamy. We don’t have three wives"]],[1623,["or four wives as the Muslims have."]],[1626,["We don’t have four husbands or something like that."]],[1629,["We have simple monogamy, a very peaceful life, very beautiful life,"]],[1634,["then why should there be problem between husband and wife?"]],[1639,["Culturally we are just the same, we believe in all the good cultures"]],[1642,["of all the world. There’s no problem."]],[1651,["One gentleman told Me that: \"My wife quarrels with Me on one point.\""]],[1654,["I said: ‘Which?’ She said: \"You do not meditate, you must meditate more.\""]],[1659,["I said: ‘That’s a good point’. He thinks as well."]],[1665,["But I told the wife that: \"You need not tell him, he’ll do it on his own.\""]],[1668,["Because you see cannot force things. This has to work out by themselves."]],[1673,["You must accept them as they are. Gradually they’ll all improve"]],[1676,["and gradually they will get there."]],[1681,["You cannot just force them."]],[1684,["We cannot just tell each other, do this way or that way."]],[1690,["Sahaja Yoga is a thing is to be imbibed. People don’t understand that."]],[1696,["They think by forcing people, by jumping at them, that’s not the way."]],[1704,["Of course if somebody is very difficult, then we have divorce in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1710,["We have not banned divorce as in the Catholic religion or anything."]],[1713,["There is divorce. But there should be something sensible about it."]],[1717,["One has to work it out."]],[1719,["Normally there should not be many cases of Sahaja Yoga, of divorce."]],[1723,["But we have because of the background, certain types"]],[1727,["of funny relations they have had or I don’t know, what to say."]],[1733,["On the whole, ninety percent or I should say","ninety-five percent marriages are quite successful,"]],[1741,["and will be more now the number will be much more, I’m sure."]],[1746,["This time we had seventy-six marriages, so you can imagine."]],[1750,["And in this one month, Yogi was after My life with his file there."]],[1756,["So there also there’s some misunderstanding that Yogi decides, he does not, poor man."]],[1763,["He cannot. But it happens sometimes, like at the last minute,"]],[1768,["they’ll bring somebody, now we cannot locate the name of that person,"]],[1772,["we just can’t find out if he’s there or not, or she’s there or not."]],[1776,["Suddenly they bring somebody, and he may say or she may say"]],[1781,["that I am there on the form and all that. Then you have to accept it."]],[1785,["If you accept such a thing then what happens"]],[1787,["that, you find that person is not a Sahaja Yogi"]],[1791,["or was not a Sahaja Yogi for such a long time. Something like that."]],[1795,["So because of three hundred to four hundred requests, you see,"]],[1799,["what can we do. I mean after all, can’t know who is who."]],[1806,["This is one thing that is very good.","At least we can control all that."]],[1813,["If something is wrong, we can find out, we can work it out"]],[1818,["and we can manage things. It’s not so difficult."]],[1822,["But the leaders must be careful because the leaders who recommend"]],[1826,["should not do something out of just some sort of a pity,"]],[1831,["or some sort of a consideration. The main consideration should be,"]],[1836,["how are the vibrations and what is the commitment in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1840,["If they are committed to Sahaja Yoga and if their vibrations are all right,"]],[1844,["then it’s all right, it’s perfect. But sometimes, you know,"]],[1848,["some people do have problems which do not come up and later on it is discovered."]],[1856,["Still, I am so happy our society is so great."]],[1860,["There’s no such society existing in the whole world."]],[1863,["And this is the society I think all these Prophets and everybody dreamt of,"]],[1867,["of such love, understanding."]],[1873,["Gradually I think we all will grow and grow and grow."]],[1879,["The growth is going on, but the atmosphere I must say is very nice,"]],[1884,["and it helps each other."]],[1891,["In Australia we had more problems in Melbourne, not in Sydney,"]],[1896,["I must give credit to your leader here, he has managed the things well."]],[1911,["There are many after him also it’s rather funny but I just don’t know,"]],[1915,["because Australia always had a problem, this kind"]],[1919,["and gradually we have sorted it out."]],[1924,["It’s a, leadership means nothing but I call it hocus-pocus."]],[1928,["It has no meaning at all. But then somebody","has to be there to contact and all that."]],[1933,["It’s something so limited."]],[1938,["But there is jealousy, there is all these things stil lingering behind"]],[1943,["and then the problems come in."]],[1948,["Gradually I am sure all of us will grow well and everything will work out"]],[1952,["in a proper way. Should work out in a proper way."]],[1956,["Our society has to show to the world that there can be a society like this."]],[1964,["Now there’s a good news which is very good, I think,"]],[1969,["we can start the calendar from that date perhaps"]],[1972,["because such a transformation is coming,"]],[1975,["that the Russian Embassy has invited Me to honor Me"]],[1979,["for the work I have done in Russia."]],[1998,["And the another good news is that Gorbachov wants to meet Me."]],[2017,["And you must be aware that in Tagliatti, is one place,"]],[2020,["Tagliatti which is an industrial town where a gentleman called Pagliati"]],[2024,["from Italy went down, he was a revolutionary."]],[2029,["And he started this place called as Togliati and the best motorcar"]],[2036,["that they make is made in this place Tagliatti, beautiful one."]],[2039,["They gave Me a model here, very beautiful, quite big. Is like a limousine."]],[2044,["Quite big. And in that one city,"]],[2051,["we have twenty-two thousand Sahaja Yogis practising, twenty-two thousand."]],[2057,["And you’ll be amazed that in Russia nowhere is less than"]],[2062,["sixteen thousand people, nowhere. Any time you go there,"]],[2066,["at least sixteen thousand people practising Sahaja Yoga, very seriously."]],[2071,["So can imagine in that country what is going to happen,"]],[2073,["though it hasn’t got food as you have here, too much to eat,"]],[2077,["but still look at the way, look at the way it has worked out."]],[2085,["How deeply they have gone into it."]],[2087,["They had never heard a word about Ganesha."]],[2091,["They never believed in God. They were in a way atheist."]],[2095,["And how much they have achieved in just…look at that."]],[2098,["How did they achieve that? The depth that they have,"]],[2103,["they just touched it. And also they invited some scientist,"]],[2107,["or two hundred scientists were there. And when I started telling about science,"]],[2111,["said: \"Mother, don’t tell us about science, had enough of it."]],[2114,["Now please tell us about Spiritual science, spirituality. That’s all.\""]],[2118,["Wonderful I tell you, such experiences."]],[2121,["And in My lecture only, just giving a lecture at the time"]],[2124,["when there were about sixteen thousand to eighteen thousand people,"]],[2128,["people got cured, just got cured."]],[2131,["Such wonders. There was one lady who came to see Me"]],[2135,["after the lecture and she was just sitting in front of Me."]],[2140,["They brought her on a wheelchair. She said: \"I couldn’t even sit.\""]],[2143,["All right. And then I said: \"You are all right\". She said: \"Really?\""]],[2147,["I said: \"Yes. You get up.\" Got up. She started walking"]],[2151,["and then she started running and everybody started…"]],[2155,["Such faith, such faith. And in","Czechoslovakia, there was one old lady."]],[2161,["They brought her with great difficulty just, held her out"]],[2165,["and brought her on the stage and she was trying to sit down."]],[2170,["Then she said: \"Mother I have complete faith in You."]],[2173,["I know You can cure Me.\" I said \"Really?\""]],[2176,["\"Yes. I am sure You can.\""]],[2179,["I said:\"You are cured.\" She got up. Everybody was surprised."]],[2184,["I said: \"Now walk. Walk now.\""]],[2187,["And then she started walking fast, and everybody started laughing."]],[2192,["But that faith, you see, is something so special."]],[2196,["I mean I have seen so many miracles happening with this faith that…"]],[2202,["There was one fellow called Mr Shukla,"]],[2205,["who is a big boss in this hotel management of Taj Mahal."]],[2212,["And this Mr Shukla heard that his mother was very sick,"]],[2217,["she was going to die. Very serious."]],[2220,["So he went to Rotak which is very far away, beyond Delhi from Mumbai,"]],[2225,["and he saw his mother in a very bad condition, very painful."]],[2230,["The doctor said she has a galloping cancer and at the most,"]],[2235,["she can live for three days. He got very much worried."]],[2239,["He came back home. He thought that:"]],[2242,["\"I couldn’t even talk to my mother, she’s in a coma,"]],[2244,["what will happen to her?\" He just sat before My photograph"]],[2250,["and prayed: \"Mother, please cure my mother."]],[2253,["I don’t want anything just now, You just cure my mother, I know You can cure her.\""]],[2258,["And within three days before, instead of dying,"]],[2260,["she was out of the hospital. He brought her to Mumbai."]],[2265,["They took her to the hospital of Thata, Thata Memorial Hospital"]],[2268,["we have, and when they examined her they said, she has no cancer."]],[2274,["He has papers. He has papers from the first hospital and from this one."]],[2280,["Recently, Rajesh told Me a story about himself."]],[2283,["He said: ‘Mother, You don’t know how many powers You have given me.’"]],[2286,["I said: \"No it’s your faith.\" His uncle was just dying."]],[2290,["They had removed his oxygen and everything."]],[2292,["His aunt sent for him and she said: \"Now he’s about to die."]],[2296,["You pray for his salvation, at least to Mother."]],[2300,["Just somehow or other try to see that he’s also gets his salvation\"."]],[2307,["He’s not a Sahaja Yogi uncle nothing of the kind."]],[2310,["So Rajesh just had his pendant, just twisted it,"]],[2316,["and then closed his eyes and prayed: \"Mother, please cure my uncle.\""]],[2322,["That’s all. He said \"it was too much of a venture to say but I did say\"."]],[2327,["And the uncle who was dying got all right, went to America"]],[2332,["and he’s back and still kicking."]],[2335,["So this is something you see we","have to go deep down into ourselves."]],[2342,["Superficiality is not going to help us."]],[2345,["If we are superficial by nature, it will not help us."]],[2349,["We have to understand ourselves. The whole mechanism is within us"]],[2353,["to attract the attention of this All-Pervading Power,"]],[2357,["to use it, to work it out. We can do marvels."]],[2361,["If we really go deep down, and become good vehicles of that All-Pervading Power."]],[2367,["That’s what we have to do. Everything can","work out. There are so many examples of this,"]],[2372,["but specially these two recently I heard about and I was amazed."]],[2378,["We have to have that depth within us to understand:"]],[2382,["\"What are we doing?\" \"Where are we?\""]],[2386,["\"We are born at this time, such an important time.\""]],[2391,["\"And that at this time, we have got Self-realization.\""]],[2395,["Very few people got it. Not only that,"]],[2400,["we have been blessed with so many things."]],[2404,["But above all we are so powerful."]],[2407,["And all these powers must be manifested, must be used,"]],[2412,["must be worked out."]],[2415,["And this superficiality of living on a very mundane style"]],[2420,["is not going to help us."]],[2424,["We have to really go deep down into ourselves."]],[2427,["I mean you are seekers, no doubt, you are seekers of truth."]],[2430,["And you have found it also. How many have found it?"]],[2434,["So many are already lost if you see as hippies, as this, as that,"]],[2438,["as TM, as another this Rajneesh."]],[2440,["I’ve seen some other lady here, two months she came."]],[2444,["How much she was caught up. She was just worried."]],[2447,["So many are lost like that. But you are the people who have got"]],[2451,["the knowledge, you are God’s people, you have got the truth with you,"]],[2455,["and all these powers are within you, but you must use them."]],[2458,["But I’ve seen even after coming to Sahaja Yoga some people get lost"]],[2462,["in the temptation because they get money."]],[2464,["Some people get some talents, they get lost in the talents."]],[2467,["Some people get some powers, they’ll get lost with them."]],[2470,["That’s not the way."]],[2473,["You see if God has given you this Realization, He expects you"]],[2478,["to give Realizations to others, to go deep down into your Self."]],[2483,["This is what we have to do is to really work out, our depth."]],[2488,["And it all exists within us. You never knew there is Spirit within us."]],[2493,["Is there. You never knew there is Ganesha within us. Is there."]],[2497,["And when you started awakening them, you found it works, it works."]],[2503,["It has worked such wonders, health wise, wealth wise, in every way."]],[2509,["But spiritually, how far we are?"]],[2512,["How do you judge a person who is spiritually evolved?"]],[2516,["Is that, even a desire works out."]],[2522,["Any, desire works out."]],[2525,["And such a person doesn’t have any funny desires."]],[2529,["Absolutely it works out."]],[2532,["And that’s what I want Australians to do because"]],[2536,["you are special people born in this country of Ganesha."]],[2540,["Perhaps we forget sometimes that you are born"]],[2544,["in the land of Shri Ganesha. Very special people."]],[2550,["Very special. So have respect for yourself."]],[2553,["And also must manifest your glory."]],[2558,["That otherwise, of all the places from Russia,"]],[2562,["Sahaja Yoga will spread, it’s not, I mean, never expected that."]],[2566,["But it may, it may, I tell you they are so deep,"]],[2569,["so very deep people, extremely deep."]],[2574,["I don’t know what has given this."]],[2576,["Materialism I think is responsible for our superficiality."]],[2580,["They are not materialistic."]],[2582,["About thirty percent people are materialistic, the rest are not."]],[2586,["They are all seeking the spirit in the real sense of the word."]],[2590,["Not just for fashion."]],[2594,["Very remarkable."]],[2596,["Very loving. Very beautiful. I was there, they came."]],[2604,["They arranged that, from one place,"]],[2610,["some people will come only for two days then two days."]],[2613,["And where I had purchased a little cottage, they,"]],[2618,["there are some places where they can live in a small little huts like that."]],[2622,["They all came and stayed there. I didn’t know where they were living"]],[2626,["or anything. Early in the morning they would come,"]],[2629,["bring some flowers, and plant the flowers in the garden, flowers, itself."]],[2634,["And would not say anything and go away. Sit down for meditation."]],[2639,["One day suddenly I discovered all of them sitting there meditating."]],[2642,["So surprised. And then it was this Gorbachov problems came up."]],[2648,["So I said: \"Now what are you going to do?\" \"What are we doing?"]],[2651,["We are in the kingdom of God. Why should we worry about Gorbachov"]],[2654,["or anyone, why should we? We are not worried.\""]],[2659,["Beautiful people. Beautiful."]],[2664,["Very collective. Also this is the blessing of communism, they are very collective."]],[2670,["I have seen that also in Calcutta.","People are extremely collective."]],[2674,["They don’t talk ill of others. Very collective people."]],[2681,["It’s not like: \"Come to my house. Oh You must visit. This thing,"]],[2685,["this is my daughter.\" That ‘my-ness’","I didn’t see, in Russia and in Calcutta."]],[2689,["I was surprised. Calcutta also has communistic, communist government."]],[2696,["How it has worked out, I can’t say."]],[2703,["So are you spreading Sahaja Yoga?"]],[2708,["How many people give Realization?"]],[2722,["Now you are doing."]],[2725,["You all have to do it. It’s very important."]],[2734,["All of you should ask this question: \"What have I done for God?\""]],[2744,["Look at these flowers that you brought."]],[2747,["They are so fragrant. They are so beautiful."]],[2751,["They are going to live for a very short time. But what pleasure."]],[2756,["What expression of your love they give. How beautiful they are."]],[2767,["Australians have a very big role to play."]],[2771,["As I expect from Ganesha, I expect from you also."]],[2823,["Yogi: And they managed to get some editorial in the newspaper,"]],[2828,["for their programs as a run-up to Your visit."]],[2831,["And in the first program they got sixty Chinese people,"]],[2836,["very good quality people."]],[2838,["Shri Mataji: Oh Look at Alex."]],[2843,["Alex is really special I must say."]],[2846,["Such a beautiful boy. When his mother died,"]],[2852,["and he was staying with Me, so I said: \"Alex won’t to go to your mother?\""]],[2858,["So he said: ‘Mother, there’s no seat available."]],[2862,["Will take about four, five days to get a seat"]],[2865,["by the time will go home."]],[2868,["So what is the need. I am with You.’"]],[2875,["I said: \"You did try?\" He said: \"I did little bit, not much,"]],[2879,["because I saw You, and I knew that my mother will have Eternal life,"]],[2884,["so why should I worry?\""]],[2887,["Now he’s saying that Alex has got sixty Chinese people in Hong Kong."]],[2893,["I couldn’t get even one."]],[2907,["Chinese are another one. If Sahaja Yoga gets into their heads,"]],[2913,["they’re very traditional, very, very deep, very deep people, Chinese."]],[2923,["The Prime Minister of China, I met him when I went there,"]],[2927,["in a photograph he’s just next to Me standing."]],[2932,["After that he became Prime Minister, not that time. A very nice man."]],[2938,["And he was asking Me about spiritual life, all the time."]],[2943,["I showed complete ignorance, you see."]],[2946,["I said 'these communists God knows what they are up to."]],[2949,["I didn’t tell him. But I think we can approach him now."]],[2954,["Somehow or another they got very fond of Me,"]],[2956,["all the Chinese government and all. Somehow."]],[2960,["Some sort of an auspiciousness they felt about Me."]],[2964,["I couldn’t understand them, what made them respect Me so much."]],[2975,["They had one exhibition, one which they had invited Me and My husband,"]],[2981,["and I couldn’t go at this point. And the next day was closed"]],[2986,["that exhibition must be closed, but they kept it open for Me alone."]],[2991,["And they said: \"You must see the exhibition, it’s important.\""]],[2995,["I don’t know, they have their own ways of understanding."]],[3002,["We had Confucius there. They follow more Confucius now,"]],[3008,["our Confucius who has talked about general well-being and all that."]],[3016,["But not so much about Tao, that they don’t talk."]],[3028,["But they are extremely humble, Chinese. Very humble."]],[3032,["You try to praise them and they say: ‘No, no."]],[3035,["We have to do much better than this, nothing.’"]],[3038,["They can never get pampered, you see, you couldn’t praise them, never."]],[3047,["They are very much like Russians in so many ways."]],[3061,["I can see Sahaja Yogis here."]],[3079,["So now, any questions?"]],[3092,["Tania is very happy with her husband. Very happy."]],[3097,["She’s very happy."]],[3100,["She has what?"]],[3103,["She too?"]],[3109,["I’ve told him what is the thing. Can you fax to Dr Spiro?"]],[3128,["She is on the liver"]],[3132,["or her husband was just like a child."]],[3136,["But see him when he sings, absolutely."]],[3142,["Remarkable. There’s that one with a super-intelligence I see."]],[3149,["Wonderful."]],[3154,["She’s happy because she can come to pujas, we are now there."]],[3158,["She is very happy about that."]],[3163,["She’s happy in Spain also."]],[3166,["Italians are better but not Spanish people."]],[3170,["Spanish are little bit - I think this American conquering"]],[3174,["has reflected in their character."]],[3183,["There are also some misunderstanding of people think that"]],[3188,["I have said that the men should dominate women. Never."]],[3192,["I am Myself a woman and then, if men start dominating Me,"]],[3196,["what will happen?"]],[3201,["But the man is the head of the family."]],[3205,["So the woman should get her authority from him,"]],[3209,["but she has her own authority, as a mother,"]],[3213,["and the husband must respect her. Otherwise he’ll never be respected."]],[3219,["So it’s kind of mutual understanding between the two, as I have said that"]],[3223,["they are the two wheels of a chariot, one on the left, one on the right."]],[3228,["If you change the wheels, then what will happen?"]],[3232,["They are absolutely equal no doubt. Absolutely equal."]],[3238,["Only they are not similar, which we must understand that we are not similar."]],[3243,["Is nice to be a woman, I tell you, it’s much better."]],[3247,["Because men have to face so many people, face so many bosses."]],[3252,["You have only one \"boss\" and if you know how to manage him…"]],[3262,["But should be done sweetly, with understanding."]],[3267,["It works out with your wisdom."]],[3272,["Must have the wisdom, how to manage it."]],[3275,["But that’s a part of the game and one has to play it well."]],[3280,["Not to feel any way dominated by anything, but it’s a"]],[3284,["kind of a framework one has to work with."]],[3288,["Now supposing this is on our head. This is not dominating us,"]],[3292,["but it has to be there."]],[3294,["So a kind of a framework is there and that framework is to be accepted."]],[3301,["Both of them should accept and the husband should never"]],[3304,["make her feel that he is dominating her."]],[3307,["Actually, in India the custom is that husbands are also very clever,"]],[3312,["not only the women. So normally they’ll give all the money"]],[3316,["to the wife to be managed and later on take away all of that."]],[3323,["And always they’ll say: \"All right\"."]],[3328,["They’ll say: \"All right\", the son to her like guru and all that."]],[3331,["Means: \"You are my lord and this and that and…\""]],[3334,["That’s how they keep it up.Because one thing they must understand"]],[3338,["is that if wife is all right, the family is all right."]],[3341,["If wife is all right, your life is all right."]],[3344,["So you must look after your wife, is very important."]],[3348,["If you understand that point the men will never try to dominate."]],[3351,["Is a wrong idea is, I don’t know from where it has trickled down"]],[3354,["that I have said, the man should dominate a woman."]],[3358,["But false prestige should not be there."]],[3362,["Like in America we went first."]],[3365,["You know American women, how they are."]],[3368,["They’ll divorce ten times and have all the money of the men."]],[3373,["The men are just like beggars and they are so rich."]],[3376,["It’s a profession with them. The women have this profession of divorcing men."]],[3382,["So they had cooked and all that. So I said: \"All right"]],[3385,["let the boys eat first and then you can eat later on.\""]],[3388,["They said: \"Mother this is domination.\" I said: \"Why?"]],[3390,["Eating first is domination or later on domination.\""]],[3393,["I think eating there later on is domination, because you are at peace, you see."]],[3398,["Eat as much as you like.","But if somebody is eating first,"]],[3402,["then he’s in a hurry to finish for the next lot that has to come up."]],[3406,["But if you are the second one, then you are relaxed,"]],[3409,["you are eating the way you like. There’s nothing to feed."]],[3412,["And moreover, it’s an attitude I think"]],[3416,["that: \"I love to cook, I love to serve, I enjoy it. I enjoy.\""]],[3421,["It’s a, temperament of a woman. She","wants to feed people, she likes it."]],[3427,["I tell you, My grandchildren, daughters, both of them,"]],[3431,["they were quite small, I asked them what do you want to be in life."]],[3436,["So they said: \"We want to be a nurse or an airhostess.\""]],[3440,["So I said: \"Why these two?\""]],[3442,["\"In these only two professions, you can give food to people. That’s why.\""]],[3447,["And they play, you know, they play like that."]],[3449,["They’ll make a tray in that they will put this thing]."]],[3452,["So this is actually innate feeling of a child."]],[3455,["Like once My daughter told that \"if somebody comes from outside,"]],[3460,["you must make him sit on the sofa there."]],[3462,["You must see that the fan is open."]],[3465,["Give them something to eat, take out from the fridge\" and all that."]],[3468,["So one washerman, the dhobi came in."]],[3471,["They called for [INAUDIBLE] to sit on the sofa. He said: \"I can’t sit.\""]],[3474,["\"You have to sit.\" \"I’m in a hurry.\" \"Nothing you have to sit.\""]],[3477,["They made him sit, opened the fan, got everything from the fridge,"]],[3481,["put it before him. \"You have to eat, otherwise we’ll feed\", you see."]],[3484,["And when My daughter entered the house, she saw these girls"]],[3487,["feeding him with their own hands. Got such a fright."]],[3492,["He said: \"I’m sorry these girls, I don’t know what are they are.\""]],[3494,["They said: \"You told us and we’re very happy we are doing that.\""]],[3498,["So innately children have this feeling in their hearts,"]],[3502,["as girls. And then when we","get a chance, we want to do it."]],[3508,["I mean, it’s such a pleasure, to feed someone."]],[3513,["You must have seen with Indian women, it’s very common,"]],[3515,["they love to feed others, they’re very happy."]],[3524,["And, I mean there’s no domination I mean if you have to feed someone,"]],[3527,["that doesn’t mean that somebody’s dominating you,"]],[3530,["these are all nonsensical norms. On the contrary it’s a privilege."]],[3536,["Otherwise after sometime, we’ll find"]],[3539,["that men will be sitting at home and the women will be going out."]],[3543,["That will be, that’s already a situation, I mean."]],[3556,["It’s hot for children I think, we are in a cabin."]],[3562,["Like the ship, I think, without the sea."]],[3578,["Entrepeneur."]],[3586,["I see."]],[3590,["It's quite a small book, I have to say."]],[3604,["So what are they saying?"]],[3627,["It is a ???"]],[3631,["And then they say \"You can do this, women can to this and...\""]],[3646,["It is very good."]],[3656,["I know."]],[3659,["You see in a - I can have the book?"]],[3663,["In Germany, when I went, there was a lady"]],[3668,["and she was telling Me that in Germany, if you get old,"]],[3674,["then the men go after younger girls and you are left alone."]],[3678,["Then you have to marry some older man,"]],[3681,["who is left by his wife or something."]],[3684,["It’s a big danger. I said: \"Why don’t you produce children."]],[3688,["I mean they get, if you have four children they get more money"]],[3691,["than the Prime Minister.\" They said: \"But then you cannot have a husband.\""]],[3695,["Either you have children or you have a husband. It’s like that."]],[3699,["It is because, I tell you, it’s very superficial,"]],[3703,["very materialistic superficial ideas, about women also. They’re a commodity."]],[3709,["In Sahaja Yoga woman, is a person as equal as a man, you see."]],[3716,["It’s very different."]],[3718,["They are just a commodity to be used, whenever they want to."]],[3724,["And I must say also some women know the weaknesses of men"]],[3728,["and try to work it out in such a manner."]],[3732,["Sometimes the women only trouble women, also."]],[3737,["They don’t understand that \"she’s a woman and I’m a woman,"]],[3740,["I should not try to trouble.\" But in sort of competitiveness,"]],[3745,["they do wrong things and try to destroy another’s life."]],[3751,["But men will have to change now, it’s coming to that."]],[3754,["All these tricks they have tried and they are now having lot of problem."]],[3760,["There are diseases that are coming up. Already","there’s lots of already these secret diseases there."]],[3765,["Apart from these secret diseases, there are diseases"]],[3768,["which are coping them, new diseases."]],[3771,["So now they’ll have to come to monogamy."]],[3774,["Once they come to monogamy, then they’ll have to realize"]],[3777,["the value of women, what they are."]],[3780,["And in this all quarrel about ordination."]],[3788,["Imagine Christianity is so stupid"]],[3791,["that they can’t have women for ordination. Now I am a Woman after all."]],[3797,["And now as a reaction, women are so angry"]],[3803,["that a girl came to Me the other day, I was in Perth, she said:"]],[3807,["\"Mother, why did you call God as ‘He’, why don’t you call as ‘She’?\""]],[3810,["I said: \"Because I am ‘She’ that’s why I have to call Him ‘He’.\""]],[3817,["But this concept is only still there in the Indian scriptures,"]],[3823,["nowhere, that there’s God","and His Power is Adi Shakti."]],[3830,["But nowhere, even Islam, in Christianity, in Judaism,"]],[3836,["in what you call, Buddhism, Jainism, nowhere."]],[3845,["They have not talked of the woman at all."]],[3849,["As if the whole world is made of men."]],[3853,["And this is surprisingly for developed countries, in Sweden and countries like this,"]],[3858,["they are talking this nonsense."]],[3866,["But the solution is only Sahaja Yoga. There’s no other solution."]],[3871,["Even women go and fight with men, what’s the use?"]],[3874,["Men fight with women, no use. So the best thing for them"]],[3878,["is to get to Sahaja Yoga and understand the value of women."]],[3882,["They understand what they are for and what is our relationship means, you see."]],[3889,["It’s such an enjoyment."]],[3892,["Stupid those people who do not want to have that enjoyment."]],[3896,["Also your media is responsible, whenever you open the television,"]],[3899,["you just find husband wife fighting, it’s too much."]],[3902,["All the time fighting, fighting, they show."]],[3904,["They never show good relationship."]],[3908,["Once I asked Derek Lee: \"Is there any novel"]],[3910,["where they show the romance of husband and wife?’"]],[3913,["He said: \"There’s no book\". No book in English."]],[3917,["The whole of English language, there’s no romance of husband and wife,"]],[3920,["can you imagine? I mean that is how you get into tragedies."]],[3924,["But in India if you see, the literature has certain ethics."]],[3931,["One of them is only the romance between husband and wife is a romance."]],[3937,["The rest of it is vulgarity."]],[3944,["This is the concept."]],[3950,["Also because mostly they are arranged marriages,"]],[3954,["so they don’t know all this romanticism before marriage."]],[3958,["So they are waiting for their wife and whole thing,"]],[3960,["and the wife becomes everything to the husband, and same, vice versa."]],[3966,["So the whole cultural concept has changed."]],[3968,["It used to be the same way before in every country,"]],[3972,["but now we are advanced you see. In that advancement, we have done this kind of a thing,"]],[3978,["is to make antagonistic societies of men and women."]],[3986,["It’s very sad. But we are very superficial."]],[3990,["But the concept itself is wrong."]],[3993,["I think the basic fundamental thing in the western culture is"]],[4000,["to see and to be seen."]],[4003,["This is what I’ve realized. That’s the comcept that people should see you"]],[4009,["and you should be able to see others.","I mean, it is so superficial."]],[4014,["Now they see somebody’s legs and somebody’s knees,"]],[4017,["I mean, what’s the use having a joyless pursuit?"]],[4020,["That person doesn’t belong to you, nothing of","the kind. What’s the use of seeing these things?"]],[4026,["But this, we have become very superficial."]],[4032,["And it’s going on and on.But I think this will all stop in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[4038,["gradually we’ll start seeing the beauty inside."]],[4043,["You know Chris Marlow, you know from London."]],[4048,["He had a wife Jane. She was quite a dry person."]],[4052,["She herself was saying that: \"Mother I am no good for him.\""]],[4057,["So they divorced. Then he told Me:"]],[4060,["\"Mother I want to marry a girl who has lots of vibrations.\""]],[4064,["I said: \"What about looks?\" \"No I don’t see any looks."]],[4067,["I want to see a girl with vibrations.’","And we had a girl from Amalhabad."]],[4073,["Very dark, extremely dark and village-like, absolutely."]],[4077,["You will never, I mean, I don’t think from your standards,"]],[4079,["she may not be beautiful, from My standards, she was very good."]],[4083,["Full of vibrations. Full of vibrations."]],[4085,["As soon as she came on the stage, he jumped, said:"]],[4089,["‘This is the one.’ He’s so tall, she’s short and [INAUDIBLE]."]],[4094,["And he looks after her so well, I tell you."]],[4098,["And then he went to her place, her village, all the way to Amalhabad."]],[4103,["My sister saw, she said: \"What a couple.\""]],[4105,["I said: \"The couple has chosen each other, I can’t help it.\""]],[4110,["He’s so fond of her, he looks after her. She’s very sweet, I mean I really love with that."]],[4117,["But I didn’t know that this fellow will have the same sort of a feeling."]],[4123,["Because we are superficial, these things are accepted."]],[4133,["You should see the inner being."]],[4136,["How beautiful it is."]],[4142,["Look at that Elizabeth Taylor, that stupid country of America."]],[4147,["This was her eighth divorce, I mean eighth honeymoon."]],[4151,["So they had three thousand or four thousand people"]],[4155,["just standing outside her house to see she is going for her honeymoon."]],[4159,["Can you imagine stupid? And there were ten helicopters hovering round."]],[4166,["And they were parachuting and some of them fell on the trees"]],[4175,["and some fell on the people who were there."]],[4178,["And they were quite excited, very sensational."]],[4181,["You know, such stupid people these Americans are."]],[4185,["I don’t know what to say."]],[4188,["And this lady had divorced eight. And this husband of hers,"]],[4191,["this one, he’s I think, I don’t know how many years younger to her,"]],[4196,["like her son. And also he’s an ordinary man or something."]],[4200,["But just for the couple."]],[4205,["She has no sense of marriage, nothing."]],[4208,["But what she has done is she’s operated her eyelids"]],[4211,["and she’s put her up and all that, and she looks younger now and she says: \"I can…\""]],[4221,["There’s no, in that country you cannot mature. So stupid."]],[4225,["I mean, I was yet to come across people in a group so stupid as that."]],[4231,["Stupidest people you see. Stupidest."]],[4234,["You can never mature this way."]],[4241,["Still Sahaja Yoga is now working. Gregoire feels so exhausted."]],[4246,["Every time he footsoaks he just lies flat, saying:"]],[4250,["\"Mother, please save me from New York.’\"It’s terrible."]],[4257,["There’s no way of maturity."]],[4261,["They invited Me for this Jungian Society and I went there."]],[4267,["Of course I didn’t read Jung much but that day I got hold of a book"]],[4269,["and I found out the reason why Jungians have failed."]],[4273,["So I talked to them they were very much impressed and all that."]],[4277,["Then the president of that society is eighty years of age,"]],[4280,["and he said that: \"Mother I must see You, I have some private thing to talk.\""]],[4284,["I said: \"All right.\" This old man came about eighty years of age."]],[4291,["He said: \"I have a very serious problem.\" I said: \"What’s the serious problem.\""]],[4295,["He says: \"You see I had a keep, because I am a Catholic"]],[4298,["I could not marry the keep but I never told my wife."]],[4302,["[INAUDIBLE] I never told my wife. So now what am I supposed to do?\""]],[4307,["He said: \"Now that my wife is dead and I want that keep"]],[4310,["to stay with Me but she has refused."]],[4312,["Can you do something to see that the keep stays with Me.\""]],[4317,["I said: \"It’s all right.\""]],[4319,["Eighty year-old man. I was turning sixty by that time."]],[4323,["An eighty year-old man talking like this to Me."]],[4327,["I said: \"Now what is happening to this man?\""]],[4330,["And he is the chairman of the Jungian Society, International."]],[4340,["See the maturity of that person. Eighty year-old."]],[4347,["In America, such cases so much."]],[4351,["Terrible things."]],[4354,["Extremely stupid and I don’t know, they have no confidence in themselves."]],[4359,["All the time they think we should not get old."]],[4362,["So there was, on the television they showed the cinema actors"]],[4366,["and actresses coming for a dance of \"shake\","]],[4370,["and they were all about ninety years of age. Then when they got down"]],[4374,["from the car only, they were shaking. I said: \"What’s the use"]],[4376,["of going to shake?\" In ninety years, they have not grown."]],[4381,["Funny dresses they were wearing and all that."]],[4384,["So when are they going to grow. There’s no maturity."]],[4387,["The atmosphere is the other way round I think."]],[4393,["Very stupid."]],[4404,["Really mad."]],[4407,["But people start copying them. Whatever they say, people listen to them"]],[4411,["even English I’m surprised. I said that: \"You are sensible people."]],[4414,["Why do you follow these stupid Americans or the French?\""]],[4419,["English people are rather mature. Maybe they lived in India,"]],[4421,["so they have matured quickly I don’t know why."]],[4424,["But compared with these stupid people they are much more mature."]],[4427,["And now they are following the American style."]],[4430,["They used to follow first the French style, now the American style."]],[4433,["They don’t stand on their own legs."]],[4440,["But Italians have a good sense of ridicule."]],[4444,["They understand what is ridiculous, that’s something about them."]],[4450,["A great sense of ridiculous."]],[4458,["It will all change in Sahaja Yoga, it will. You are in the Kingdom of God."]],[4466,["You shouldn’t worry about these things."]],[4469,["But what to do? If they join us they can come up. But they don’t want to,"]],[4472,["let them be like as they are."]],[4484,["What else?"]],[4509,["If the lymphatic system is under attack, you may be left-sided."]],[4516,["You see it is, on the whole, there are only two types of problems,"]],[4520,["actually. Third type doesn’t exist or doesn’t bother us."]],[4524,["One is the left another is the right, you see."]],[4527,["Now the lymphatic system is actually the combination of both."]],[4531,["It’s a psychosomatic disease."]],[4534,["For that you have to do just three-candle treatment."]],[4537,["You see it is reduced to such a simple thing,"]],[4540,["either you do three-candle treatment, or you do water treatment."]],[4545,["The third type is the one where you have been to wrong gurus,"]],[4551,["in the center."]],[4555,["If you have run some wrong type of meditation, all kinds, that's the third one."]],[4560,["For that also it’s three-candle treatment, mostly."]],[4564,["Or maybe little comes there’s a little change also sometimes."]],[4567,["But whatever it is, this is very simple for physical."]],[4571,["Anybody has lymphatic system problem has to do"]],[4574,["left side treatment first. So this is psychosomatic."]],[4578,["First you must get rid of the psycho side, so do the left side."]],[4582,["When it is cleared out, then right side is not difficult."]],[4587,["If you are too right-sided, then what happens?"]],[4591,["Like a pendulum, you move from right to left."]],[4594,["Then psychosomatic troubles start."]],[4597,["The best is first to remove the left, then is look after the right."]],[4603,["Sahaja Yoga is a very simple way of clearing. It works."]],[4609,["Somebody should help you in left side is to give you"]],[4612,["bandhan on your chakras with a candle."]],[4616,["Put a candle on one side of the Left Swadisthana"]],[4620,["and also one before the photograph."]],[4629,["Because it’s all due to viruses."]],[4632,["And the viruses are there because your attention in the left."]],[4635,["Once your attention goes away from there, you are rid of that."]],[4639,["All right?"]],[4642,["It’s not complicated. Sahaja Yoga is very simple."]],[4646,["You know we have cured people who were about to go on the dialysis."]],[4653,["Kidney has been cured. Can you imagine?"]],[4655,["Of course people with blood cancer that has been cured, no doubt."]],[4658,["But imagine the kidney, people were going on the dialysis."]],[4678,["Of course. I mean, we make the human beings."]],[4683,["You first, if you are evolving,"]],[4687,["you are also evolving human beings with you."]],[4691,["So it’s for the emancipation of the whole world."]],[4699,["It’s not only your evolution. No, no, not at all. That was over."]],[4704,["Now I have told about that in [INAUDIBLE], is that,"]],[4710,["from Buddha’s future they say there will be a future Buddha"]],[4715,["who will be Maitreya. Maitreya means Three Mothers together,"]],[4719,["will be the future Buddha. And that is called as Bodhisattva."]],[4725,["Now the Bodhisattva is the One who will become Buddha,"]],[4729,["means who will get enlightened and will work for the other people."]],[4736,["So is already described, and you don’t have to suffer,"]],[4739,["you don’t have to do anything as it was before individually,"]],[4742,["but now you’ll work with the collective."]],[4747,["So, you have to work with the collective otherwise you have no meaning."]],[4751,["Also you cannot be cleansed unless and until you come to collective."]],[4754,["If you say: \"I’m staying at home and I’m doing all the puja"]],[4756,["and all that\", doesn’t work out."]],[4760,["Like a nail if it is cut, it doesn’t grow."]],[4769,["Very simple."]],[4778,["It’s not for one person no doubt. I mean how can it be, for one."]],[4783,["Because the time has come for doing collective work now."]],[4786,["The whole world has to change."]],[4794,["Yogi: Shri Mother, will we ever be able to go to Tasmania?"]],[4815,["Yes, Tasmania, they have to come. They have to come here."]],[4819,["Like you see, Sicily, we are now having lots of Sahaja Yogis there."]],[4823,["They all came down. Then I can now go to Sicily."]],[4826,["We have very few people in Tasmania."]],[4829,["Now that’s the point."]],[4831,["So when they will come and they’ll get their Realization then I can go."]],[4837,["You see, if I go to a place it is like,"]],[4844,["should I say, the seeds being sprouted and nobody to look after."]],[4849,["Yogi: There were quite a number of people who came from Tasmania."]],[4855,["Shri Mataji: They should come, they should."]],[4858,["They should go with their bandhans and try to save their country."]],[4861,["Yes, they should. If they go and establish it, I’ll definitely go."]],[4866,["It’s quite a remarkable place that Tasmania is."]],[4870,["Talisman means, talisman all the secret, magic."]],[4880,["It is talisman, from that Tasmania word must have come."]],[4885,["Yogi: How many Tasmanians are there here?"]],[4891,["Shri Mataji: Still very few to fight those negativities there."]],[4896,["Very negative. Very negative, isn’t it?"]],[4903,["Just like, we have Calcutta."]],[4908,["Too much of black magic. Too much."]],[4910,["But gradually we have now got it out. It’s changed."]],[4916,["One side is they are all full of black magic, those who believe in God."]],[4921,["The another side are communists. But still now we have thousands."]],[4926,["It is remarkable. But people had to work very hard for it, very hard."]],[4935,["So many people went from Nagpur, from Mumbai, from Delhi to help them."]],[4945,["Still some places I’ve not been, like Ceylon, Assam."]],[4950,["We have some coming from there."]],[4953,["I told them next year I’ll try to be there."]],[4974,["Hands like that? You want to know what’s the symbol?"]],[4980,["This is for assurance."]],[4984,["See? This is for assurance. It has powers."]],[4987,["This hand has tremendous powers. And this one is for giving."]],[4993,["You see? So these are two aspects."]],[4996,["But actually as you know this is the power of action."]],[5003,["So it acts. And this is the power of desire."]],[5007,["So this is the Love that’s flowing of your Mother,"]],[5010,["and this is how She is active."]],[5016,["But now I have given up. I used to do it in the beginning it was needed,"]],[5019,["now it’s not necessary. It works even without that."]],[5025,["They are called as mudras which I used in the beginning."]],[5028,["Now I don’t use that, mostly."]],[5050,["Come along, who want to eat chana?"]],[5054,["For chana, they learn."]],[5065,["Who has got children now? Small a little bit."]]]);
